tried, but mail bounced ...

rings of adornment affect your charisma stat by the amount of
their enchantment (i.e. a +3 ring adds three, if possible, to your
charisma).  this is assuming nethack 3.0.

okay, what does your charisma stat affect???

various interactions between you and certain monsters susceptible
to your charisma (i.e. shopkeepers and seducers).  it goes without
saying that more charisma is considered a good thing.  interestingly
enough, under the right conditions, an enthralled monster can
help you identify the ring ...

